    "updated_at": "2022-04-20T04:57:42Z",
    "body": "It looks like GitHub would indeed take care of most of the hard work:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"512\" alt=\"CleanShot 2022-04-20 at 01 47 18@2x\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4658208/164152485-62a926ab-44b3-47bb-a244-002b35560d55.png\">\r\n\r\nSome tasks that would need doing:\r\n- [ ] Update references to `master` in our action workflows\r\n- [ ] Update [Brew formula](https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-core/blob/master/Formula/starship.rb#L7)\r\n\r\nDoes anything else come to mind?",
